   341→### Memory Management Implementation
   342→
   343→**Efficient State Management Pattern**:
   344→
   345→```typescript
   346→private getFilteredData(): FilteredData {
   347→    // Use memoization to avoid recomputing filtered data
   348→    const cacheKey = Array.from(this.selectedModels).sort().join(',');
   349→    
   350→    if (this.filteredDataCache?.key === cacheKey) {
   351→        return this.filteredDataCache.data;
   352→    }
   353→    
   354→    const filteredData = {
   355→        conversations: this.conversations.filter(conv => 
   356→            this.selectedModels.size === 0 || 
   357→            this.selectedModels.has(conv.model)
   358→        ),
   359→        rawPairs: this.processedPairs.filter(pair => 
   360→            this.selectedModels.size === 0 || 
   361→            this.selectedModels.has(pair.model)
   362→        )
   363→    };
   364→    
   365→    this.filteredDataCache = { key: cacheKey, data: filteredData };
   366→    return filteredData;
   367→}
   368→```
